rch Institutes Research Facilities About Our History Facts and Figures University Vision and Mission Welcoming to All Accessibility Alumni Network Leadership and Administration Partnerships and Community Relations Living in Central New York Help and Contacts Athletics Alumni Network News Events Make a Gift Information for Admitted Students Current Students Veteran and Military Students Faculty and Staff Alumni Community and Visitors Parents and Families Search Helpful Links Academic Calendars Events Human Resources MySlice Registrar Libraries Syracuse University Academics Career Paths Explore majors and minors based on your career goals, and see how Syracuse University’s programs connect you with leading scientists and scholars who can prepare you for a career built on your passions. Discover career paths in... Architecture Art and Design Business and Finance Communications and Writing Education Engineering Health and Human Services Humanities and Languages Law and Government Performing Arts Science and Mathematics Social Justice and Advocacy Social Sciences Sports Technology, Data and AI Architecture Shape the spaces where we live, work and play in an industry at the nexus of design, function and human experience. Explore architecture path Art and Design Expand your creative talents and prepare for a career where you can inspire, entertain, innovate or enlighten. Explore art and design path Business and Finance Develop your creative thinking and sharpen your skills for a career in business, where innovations and disruptions occur rapidly on a global scale. Explore business and finance path Communications and Writing Prepare to inform, persuade and influence in a career where versatile communicators are in high demand. Explore communications and writing path Education Help build a promising future with a career that nurtures, enlightens and empowers young people in the classroom and beyond. Explore education path Engineering Improve everyday life by creating solutions for our environment, health and systems in careers across a vast range of industries. Explore engineering path Health and Human Services Enhance the well-being of individuals, families and communities in a career where human connections promote values like sustainability and social justice. Explore health and human services path Humanities and Languages Bring your critical thinking skills and cultural insights to a wide range of careers where you can expand your knowledge and enrich the human experience. Explore humanities and languages path Law and Government Turn your passion for public service into a career dedicated to developing meaningful policy and upholding a system of justice. Explore law and government path Performing Arts Develop your artistry, vision and leadership as you prepare for a career that brings inspiring performances to life. Explore performing arts path Science and Mathematics Apply your analytical, problem-solving skills and open doors to the future with a high-demand math or science career. Explore science and mathematics path Social Justice and Advocacy Support local, national and global communities in a career promoting civic engagement and lasting social change. Explore social justice and advocacy path Social Sciences Use your insights into human behavior and institutions in a career that enhances individual lives and our broader social systems. Explore social sciences career path Sports Break ground, make an impact and explore your passions in one of the fastest growing in-demand industries. Explore sports path Technology, Data and AI Drive decision-making and lead change managing the systems and tools that are shaping the future of every industry. Explore technology, data and AI path 900 South Crouse Ave. Syracuse, NY 13244 315.443.1870 Contact Us Emergency Contact Academics Admissions and Aid Campus Life Research About Athletics Alumni Network News Events Make a Gift Information for Admitted Students Current Students Veteran and Military Students Faculty and Staff Alumni Community and Visitors Parents and Families Blackboard MySlice Stories Campus Map Campus Store Work at Syracuse Human Resources Syracuse University Brand Accreditation Title IX Accessibility Privacy Policy Consumer Information"
