Research Institutes Research Facilities About Our History Facts and Figures University Vision and Mission Welcoming to All Accessibility Alumni Network Leadership and Administration Partnerships and Community Relations Living in Central New York Help and Contacts Athletics Alumni Network News Events Make a Gift Information for Admitted Students Current Students Veteran and Military Students Faculty and Staff Alumni Community and Visitors Parents and Families Search Helpful Links Academic Calendars Events Human Resources MySlice Registrar Libraries Syracuse University Faculty and Staff We are dedicated to your success by providing the resources, services and support that our faculty and staff members need to succeed. Popular Resources MySlice Blackboard Email Human Resources Employee Benefits Wellness Initiative Employee Benefits We offer a comprehensive benefits program that provides flexibility and choice to meet the unique needs of our employees. Qualified employees are eligible for most of the benefit plans immediately upon hire. Learn more about employee benefits Wellness Initiative The Syracuse University Wellness Initiative provides learning opportunities, activities, programs and other resources needed to empower and encourage our faculty and staff to make choices and changes that lead to a balanced and healthy lifestyle. Explore wellness initiatives Human Resources Our Office of Human Resources is dedicated to the success of our faculty, staff and student employees. Our priorities are clearly defined and focused on helping employees achieve their career goals and work life balance. From training and professional development to wellness and financial planning, our team is ready to provide support and professional expertise for employees in the modern workplace. Learn more about Human Resources Work at Syracuse University Our University community is one of undeniable spirit and extraordinary academics. If you’re ready to welcome, challenge, appreciate and engage our students and University community, all while growing professionally and bleeding Orange, we’d love to hear from you. Explore working at Syracuse Calendars Academic Calendar Holiday Calendar Pay Calendar Courses and Classrooms Course Catalog Classroom Resource Guide Schedule of Classes Class Scheduling Time Blocks Textbook Ordering Course Syllabus Template Academic Event Room Reservation Forms HR Forms Comptroller Forms Registrar Forms Resources Office of the Provost Office of the Registrar Wellness and Worklife Employment, Workplace Rules, Benefits and Governmental Notices Carebridge: Faculty and Staff Assistance Program Office of the University Ombuds Office of People and Culture (requires NetID to access) Quick Links Academic Departments Campus Map Campus Shuttle Current Job Openings Information Technology Services Libraries Office of Sponsored Programs Parking Schools and Colleges Syracuse University Policies University Senate Arts at Syracuse University Apply Now Request Information Tour Campus 900 South Crouse Ave. Syracuse, NY 13244 315.443.1870 Contact Us Emergency Contact Academics Admissions and Aid Campus Life Research About Athletics Alumni Network News Events Make a Gift Information for Admitted Students Current Students Veteran and Military Students Faculty and Staff Alumni Community and Visitors Parents and Families Blackboard MySlice Stories Campus Map Campus Store Work at Syracuse Human Resources Syracuse University Brand Accreditation Title IX Accessibility Privacy Policy Consumer Information"
